@title EMC fix-it: with only one duct the avoid-duct preview says it clears nothing
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# On the one-duct cabinet the router has no other duct to use: the preview says no finding is cleared, instead of promising a fix. The pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Preview: Route the wire in another duct"
click_text "Preview: Route the wire in another duct" #1
wait 10
expect "No finding is cleared or added by this fix."
shot 01-preview-nothing-cleared
check_layout
